<section class="why-section section-spacing" aria-label="Why AltrixWear">
  <div class="page-container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <span class="eyebrow">The AltrixWear Difference</span>
      <h2>WHY ALTRIXWEAR?</h2>
      <p>We believe dependable activewear should be accessible to anyone striving to improve their strength, health, and confidence.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="why-grid">
      <!-- Pillar 1 -->
      <div class="why-card">
        <span class="why-card-num">01 / FIT</span>
        <h3 class="why-card-title">PRECISION CONTOURS</h3>
        <p class="why-card-desc">
          Tailored specifically around natural athletic anatomy. Our pieces provide secure compression that supports posture and muscle groups without bunching or pinching.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Pillar 2 -->
      <div class="why-card">
        <span class="why-card-num">02 / FUNCTION</span>
        <h3 class="why-card-title">TRAINING-READY FABRICS</h3>
        <p class="why-card-desc">
          Squat-proof weaves, breathable moisture dissipation, and durable flatlock seams designed to endure high-volume training sessions and weekly laundry cycles.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Pillar 3 -->
      <div class="why-card">
        <span class="why-card-num">03 / VALUE</span>
        <h3 class="why-card-title">ACCESSIBLE ESSENTIALS</h3>
        <p class="why-card-desc">
          By operating direct-to-consumer and eliminating excessive marketing overhead, we deliver premium performance activewear without the premium-brand markup.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

